  "content": "<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:#f00;font-size:36px\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/FsqPTns/One-Summer-Block.png\" alt=\"\"></strong></span></h2><hr><p style=\"text-align:center\"><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\">這是一個類似 <em>IJAMinecraft</em> 的 <strong>OneBlock</strong> 地圖的冒險地圖。</span><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\">在這張地圖上，你將以一個漂浮在虛空之上的單一方塊出現。</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">你將永遠破壞一個<strong>夏日幸運方塊</strong>！祝你好運！</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/ypcDxRm/Summer-lucky-block.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"489\" height=\"275\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">歡迎來到 <em><strong>夏日幸運單方塊！</strong></em></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">這張 Minecraft 地圖將帶你踏上一段以</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><em><strong>單一方塊</strong></em> —— <strong>夏日</strong><em><strong>幸運方塊</strong></em> 為中心的刺激且充滿挑戰的冒險。</span><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\">準備好體驗一場充滿<strong>驚喜</strong>、<strong>危險</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">和<strong>機會</strong>的旅程，探索這個獨特而有限的世界吧。</span></p><hr><p style=\"text-align:left\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/K6kBFgG/2023-07-09-17-43-56.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"512\" height=\"288\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/4YQSMmq/This-map-requiere-mod.png\" width=\"1205\" height=\"56\"></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#f00\"><a style=\"color:#f00\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/lucky-block\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/lucky-block</a></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><br><br></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/82Bn5Sx/This-Map-requieres-the-addons.png\" width=\"894\" height=\"49\"></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"color:#f00;font-size:24px\"><em>夏日幸運方塊</em>：</span><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/customization/summer-lucky-block\" rel=\"nofollow\">www.curseforge.com/minecraft/customization/summer-lucky-block</a><br></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><hr><h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><br><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fthisboy\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-family:'arial black', sans-serif\">按此獲得 25% 折扣</span></a></span><br><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fthisboy\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/e786a9cc-b379-4f61-b906-ed81aeb57024.png\" width=\"1351\" height=\"224\"></a><br><br></h2><hr><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><em>我的 Discord：</em></strong><a href=\"https://discord.gg/B9rysAEFGk\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://1000logos.net/wp-content/uploads/2021/06/Discord-logo.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"427\" height=\"240\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>",
